<body class="privacy-terms">
  <h2>Delete Your NameBaby Account</h2>
  <p>This page explains how to ask Danger Apps Inc. to delete your account for the NameBaby app and the
      information associated with it.</p>

  <h3>How to Request Deletion</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>Send an email to
        <a href="mailto:info@dangerapps.com?subject=Delete%20my%20NameBaby%20account">info@dangerapps.com</a>
        with the subject “Delete my NameBaby account”.</li>
    <li>Send it from the email address you use to sign in to NameBaby, so that we can confirm the account
        is yours.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>You do not need to have the app installed to make a request.</p>

  <h3>What Is Deleted</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Your account: your email address and user ID.</li>
    <li>The information synced to our cloud database under your account: your settings (including the baby's
        last name, your first name and the “baby's ethnicity” setting), your baby details, your lists of liked,
        disliked and short-listed names, and your Premium status.</li>
    <li>Your information in any partner sharing record: your first name, your email address and your liked,
        disliked and short-listed names. <span class="confirm">[CONFIRM: that your information is removed from
        the shared record, and what your partner sees afterwards.]</span></li>
  </ul>

  <h3>What Is Not Deleted</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Information stored on your device.</strong> To remove it, uninstall the app.
        <span class="confirm">[CONFIRM: that uninstalling removes it.]</span></li>
    <li><strong>Your Premium subscription.</strong> Deleting your account does not cancel a subscription.
        Subscriptions are billed by Apple or Google, so please cancel in your App Store or Google Play
        subscription settings before you ask us to delete your account.</li>
    <li><strong>Your partner's own information.</strong> If you linked accounts with a partner, their account
        and lists remain.</li>
    <li><strong>Advertising and analytics information held by Google.</strong> This is not linked to your
        NameBaby account. See our <a href="/name_baby/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for how to control it.
        <span class="confirm">[CONFIRM: that analytics events do not carry the account's user ID.]</span></li>
  </ul>

  <h3>How Long It Takes</h3>
  <p>We delete your account and synced information within 30 days of receiving your request, and we will email
      you to confirm when it is done. Copies in our cloud provider's backup systems may take up to 180 days to
      be removed.</p>
  <p class="confirm">[CONFIRM: 30 days and the confirmation email are my placeholders, set what you can commit
      to. The 180 days comes from Google's Firebase documentation.]</p>

  <h3>Deleting Some Information Without Deleting Your Account</h3>
  <p>You can also ask us to delete particular information without deleting your account by emailing the same
      address and telling us what you would like removed.</p>
  <p class="confirm">[CONFIRM: only keep this section if you are willing to handle partial requests.]</p>

  <h3>Questions</h3>
  <p>If you have any questions, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@dangerapps.com">info@dangerapps.com</a> or
      see our <a href="/name_baby/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
  </body>
